  "title": "Mom's Sausage Roll",
  "description": "These hearty rolls are especially tasty during the holidays! Sausage, cheese and eggs are baked into rich, delicious rolls that may be served warm or cold.",
  "authors": [
    "Rose Lorden"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-02T02:43:47-04:00",
